---
import '@sparaton/ui/styles.css';
---
<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow,noarchive"/><title>Sparaton Admin</title><script is:inline>
(()=>{try{const saved=localStorage.getItem('sparaton-theme');const dark=matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches;document.documentElement.dataset.theme=saved==='light'||saved==='dark'?saved:dark?'dark':'light'}catch{}})();
</script></head><body><a class="skip-link" href="#content">Skip to content</a><header class="shell site-header"><strong style="letter-spacing:.1em">SPARATON / ADMIN</strong><nav class="nav"><a href="#tickets">Tickets</a><a href="/content">Content</a><a href="/operations">Operations</a><a href="#traffic">Site Traffic</a></nav></header><main id="content"><section class="shell hero" style="padding-block:4rem"><div><p class="eyebrow">Operations</p><h1 style="font-size:clamp(3.5rem,8vw,7rem)">Admin workspace</h1></div><p class="lede">Live operational data only. If an integration is missing, this panel says so instead of drawing decorative graphs.</p></section><section class="section"><div class="shell"><div class="metric-grid"><div class="metric"><span class="eyebrow">Open tickets</span><strong id="open-count">…</strong></div><div class="metric"><span class="eyebrow">Waiting on staff</span><strong id="waiting-count">…</strong></div><div class="metric"><span class="eyebrow">Analytics</span><strong id="analytics-state" style="font-size:1.2rem">Checking</strong></div></div></div></section><section class="section" id="tickets"><div class="shell"><div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">Tickets</p><h2>Inbox</h2></div><div id="ticket-list" style="display:grid;gap:1px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line)"></div></div></section><section class="section" id="traffic"><div class="shell"><div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">Operations</p><h2>Traffic & service health</h2></div><div class="grid-3"><article class="card"><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;align-items:start"><div><p class="eyebrow">Cloudflare</p><h3>Site Traffic</h3></div><label>Range<select id="traffic-range"><option value="24h">24 hours</option><option value="7d" selected>7 days</option><option value="30d">30 days</option></select></label></div><p class="muted" id="traffic-copy">Loading configuration state…</p><div class="metric-grid" style="margin-top:1rem"><div class="metric"><span class="eyebrow">Requests</span><strong id="traffic-requests">—</strong></div><div class="metric"><span class="eyebrow">Visits</span><strong id="traffic-visits">—</strong></div></div><div id="traffic-breakdown" class="muted" style="display:grid;gap:.45rem;margin-top:1rem"></div></article><article class="card"><p class="eyebrow">Free-tier architecture</p><h3>Integration health</h3><div id="operations-health" style="display:grid;gap:.55rem"></div><p class="muted" style="margin-top:1rem">Configuration state is reported without displaying credentials or inventing provider quota.</p></article><article class="card"><p class="eyebrow">Synchronization</p><h3>External data</h3><div id="sync-health" class="muted" style="display:grid;gap:.55rem"></div><p class="muted" id="backend-errors" style="margin-top:1rem"></p></article></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="shell"><div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">Publishing</p><h2>Quick publishing</h2></div><div class="grid-3"><form id="project-form" class="card"><h3>Project</h3><label>Slug<input name="slug" required pattern="[a-z0-9-]+"/></label><label>Name<input name="name" required/></label><label>Summary<textarea name="summary" required></textarea></label><label>Status<select name="status"><option>in-development</option><option>active</option><option>stable</option><option>research</option><option>archived</option></select></label><label><input type="checkbox" name="published"/> Published</label><button class="button" type="submit">Save project</button></form><form id="post-form" class="card"><h3>Post</h3><label>Slug<input name="slug" required pattern="[a-z0-9-]+"/></label><label>Title<input name="title" required/></label><label>Summary<textarea name="summary" required></textarea></label><label>Body (Markdown)<textarea name="bodyMarkdown" required></textarea></label><label>Type<select name="type"><option>announcement</option><option>project-update</option><option>engineering-note</option><option>release</option><option>research</option><option>studio-news</option><option>creator-update</option></select></label><label><input type="checkbox" name="published"/> Published</label><button class="button" type="submit">Save post</button></form><article class="card"><h3>Full content system</h3><p class="muted">Structured publishing lives in Content. Relationship graphs, public media, canned staff replies, privacy controls, and audit filtering live in Operations.</p><p><a class="button" href="/content">Content →</a> <a class="button" href="/operations">Operations →</a></p></article></div><p id="admin-message" role="status" class="muted"></p></div></section></main><script is:inline src="/admin.js"></script></body></html>
